WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.724 --> 00:00:06.568
Ben finally spotted Waldo in the hallway after English.

2
00:00:06.588 --> 00:00:12.812
"Waldo!" called Ben, hurrying up to him.

3
00:00:12.832 --> 00:00:18.616
Waldo spun around, sending his glasses flying off his nose.

4
00:00:31.712 --> 00:00:33.513
He picked them up and peered at Ben.

5
00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:38.876
"Hey, you're the new ghost Ben, right?

6
00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:41.097
How do you like Monster Academy so far?"

7
00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:44.219
"It's great," said Ben.

8
00:00:44.239 --> 00:00:47.741
"Except for the crazy brooms crashing everywhere.

9
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:50.562
I was looking forward to the Monster Mash dance.

10
00:00:50.822 --> 00:00:52.443
I hear it's always really fun."

11
00:00:54.244 --> 00:00:55.905
"It is," Waldo agreed.

12
00:00:55.925 --> 00:00:57.786
"Too bad Mr.

13
00:00:57.846 --> 00:00:59.487
Freaky had to cancel it for now.

14
00:00:59.907 --> 00:01:01.773
But don't worry," he went on.

15
00:01:01.793 --> 00:01:04.715
"I'm a pretty amazing wizard.

16
00:01:05.135 --> 00:01:08.118
I can figure out who's flying the brooms in no time at all."

17
00:01:09.639 --> 00:01:10.940
"Wow, that's great!"

18
00:01:11.301 --> 00:01:11.861
Ben said.

19
00:01:11.881 --> 00:01:13.262
"What are you going to do?"

20
00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:18.206
"I'll formulate a truth potion," Waldo answered.

21
00:01:18.226 --> 00:01:23.471
"I'll give it to every single student at Monster Academy and then question them, one by one."

22
00:01:26.573 --> 00:01:29.276
"Oh um Ben hesitated.

23
00:01:30.872 --> 00:01:33.473
"There are hundreds of students at Monster Academy.

24
00:01:33.873 --> 00:01:36.675
Won't it take a really long time to question everyone?"

25
00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:41.837
"Hmm I guess you're right Hey!"

26
00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:44.798
Waldo suddenly had a big smile.

27
00:01:45.678 --> 00:01:46.739
"You're a ghost!

28
00:01:47.159 --> 00:01:49.320
You could investigate without anyone seeing you!"

29
00:01:53.902 --> 00:01:56.203
"I can move quietly," said Ben.

30
00:01:56.223 --> 00:01:58.444
"But I'm not invisible."

31
00:02:00.468 --> 00:02:03.389
"Oh, right," said Waldo, rubbing his chin.

32
00:02:03.409 --> 00:02:05.830
"I know!

33
00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:07.290
I'll cast a sleep spell!"

34
00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.111
"Okay," said Ben.

35
00:02:11.712 --> 00:02:13.692
This idea sounded a little better to him.

36
00:02:13.712 --> 00:02:15.993
"When can we start?"

37
00:02:17.793 --> 00:02:19.094
Waldo glanced around.

38
00:02:19.114 --> 00:02:24.555
"I can do the spell now if we hurry," he whispered.

39
00:02:24.575 --> 00:02:26.096
"Follow me!"

40
00:02:31.116 --> 00:02:33.578
Ben followed Waldo into the empty library.

41
00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.883
Waldo took an enormous book out of his backpack and flipped through the pages.

42
00:02:40.903 --> 00:02:44.185
"Here it is," he said.

43
00:02:44.205 --> 00:02:46.086
"The sleep spell."

44
00:02:48.128 --> 00:02:49.229
"Are you sure it will work?"

45
00:02:49.889 --> 00:02:50.510
asked Ben.

46
00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:53.912
"I've never actually tried it," said Waldo.

47
00:02:53.932 --> 00:02:59.576
"But don't worry—I'm very skilled at magic."

48
00:03:00.992 --> 00:03:03.173
"That's what I've heard," Ben murmured.

49
00:03:06.055 --> 00:03:07.935
Waldo quietly recited the spell.

50
00:03:14.779 --> 00:03:16.740
When he was finished, he looked at Ben.

51
00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:20.001
"The spell is done," said Waldo.

52
00:03:20.021 --> 00:03:22.342
"Go look for clues.

53
00:03:22.522 --> 00:03:25.424
But be quick—the spell lasts for only one hour!"

54
00:03:39.628 --> 00:03:42.730
Ben decided to search the broom-flying classroom first.

55
00:03:52.776 --> 00:03:55.277
The room's closet was filled with witches' brooms.

56
00:03:56.578 --> 00:03:59.559
Each one was marked "MA," for Monster Academy.

57
00:03:59.579 --> 00:04:04.042
"I don't see any clues in here," he murmured.

58
00:04:04.062 --> 00:04:07.284
"Just a bunch of—what's that?"

59
00:04:08.428 --> 00:04:11.130
Ben reached down and picked up a small object.

60
00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:16.193
"I wonder what this is," he thought, slipping it into his pocket.

61
00:04:16.213 --> 00:04:18.315
"It looks a little like a tooth."

62
00:04:19.455 --> 00:04:22.357
Suddenly a voice said, "What are you doing here?"

63
00:04:23.278 --> 00:04:24.979
Ben spun around and saw Winnie.

64
00:04:25.339 --> 00:04:26.860
Her eyes were wide open.

65
00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.862
"Oh," said Ben.

66
00:04:29.882 --> 00:04:34.525
"I uh Why was Winnie awake?

67
00:04:35.646 --> 00:04:38.128
And what was she doing in the broom-flying classroom?

68
00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.041
Winnie started talking really fast.

69
00:04:42.061 --> 00:04:46.302
"I was in math class, but suddenly I just couldn't sit still.

70
00:04:46.642 --> 00:04:47.302
No one could.

71
00:04:47.722 --> 00:04:52.544
I mean, who wants to do math when you feel like running or going flying or something?

72
00:04:52.644 --> 00:04:53.904
Right? Even Mr.

73
00:04:53.984 --> 00:04:55.484
Slime didn't want to be there.

74
00:04:55.504 --> 00:04:56.885
'Class dismissed!'

75
00:04:57.225 --> 00:05:02.246
he said, and then he ran out of the room so he could go jogging around the track."

76
00:05:03.507 --> 00:05:05.167
Winnie ran over to the brooms.

77
00:05:05.187 --> 00:05:08.548
"Oh, how I wish I could fly them!"

78
00:05:10.452 --> 00:05:12.153
"See you, Winnie," Ben called.

79
00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:16.775
She was acting really weird.

80
00:05:17.735 --> 00:05:20.817
He had to find Waldo right away to see what was going on.

81
00:05:22.757 --> 00:05:24.438
Earlier the halls had been empty.

82
00:05:25.539 --> 00:05:27.960
Now teachers and students were rushing around.

83
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.961
In the middle of the chaos, Waldo made his way toward Ben.

84
00:05:31.981 --> 00:05:35.883
"Something happened with the sleep spell!"

85
00:05:36.263 --> 00:05:37.564
whispered Waldo in a panic.

86
00:05:38.624 --> 00:05:41.205
"Instead of putting everyone to sleep, it made them wide-awake!"

87
00:05:41.225 --> 00:05:43.205
"You're not kidding!"

88
00:05:43.625 --> 00:05:44.186
said Ben.

89
00:05:44.206 --> 00:05:45.586
"What happened?"

90
00:05:47.446 --> 00:05:48.707
Waldo looked sheepish.

91
00:05:48.727 --> 00:05:52.768
"I guess even a great wizard like me can make a mistake sometimes."

92
00:05:52.788 --> 00:05:56.169
"I guess," Ben muttered.

93
00:05:58.269 --> 00:05:59.630
Waldo held up his hands.

94
00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.170
"Don't worry.

95
00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:02.630
I have another spell I can use.

96
00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:03.191
Follow me."

97
00:06:05.611 --> 00:06:08.132
Ben followed Waldo to the library once again.

98
00:06:09.016 --> 00:06:12.839
The wizard opened his big book of spells and recited some new words.

99
00:06:12.859 --> 00:06:20.323
"This spell will make everyone forget everything that happens during the next hour," said Waldo.

100
00:06:20.343 --> 00:06:25.226
"Even if other monsters see you snooping around, they won't remember."

101
00:06:25.246 --> 00:06:28.308
"Awesome," said Ben.

102
00:06:28.328 --> 00:06:30.629
"Let's go search for clues!"

103
00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.452
Ben and Waldo hurried back into the hallway.

104
00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:40.302
Instantly all the monsters—students and teachers—fell silent.

105
00:06:40.803 --> 00:06:42.303
They all stared at Waldo.

106
00:06:44.364 --> 00:06:46.366
A purple monster ran up to Waldo.

107
00:06:46.386 --> 00:06:50.268
"Oh, Waldo, what a wonderful wizard you are!"

108
00:06:51.969 --> 00:06:54.150
A witch pushed the purple monster aside.

109
00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:57.051
"Waldo! You are so cute!"

110
00:06:57.071 --> 00:07:00.613
"Will you marry me, Waldo?"

111
00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:02.074
shouted a mummy.

112
00:07:02.094 --> 00:07:05.216
"Will you go to the Monster Mash with me?"

113
00:07:05.876 --> 00:07:06.777
cried a goblin.

114
00:07:06.797 --> 00:07:09.019
"What is going on?"

115
00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:10.341
cried Ben.

116
00:07:10.361 --> 00:07:13.424
"Why is everyone in love with you all of sudden?"

117
00:07:14.605 --> 00:07:16.507
Waldo put his palm to his forehead.

118
00:07:16.527 --> 00:07:20.051
"Ugh! I didn't cast a forgetting spell.

119
00:07:20.451 --> 00:07:21.933
I cast a love spell!"
